THIS IS A DECOY, NOT A VALID USD FILE.

It sits in fixture/ (the root layer's directory) with the same basename as
fixture/sub/leaf.usda. sub/mid.usda authors `references = @./leaf.usda@`, which
must anchor to sub/ (mid.usda's directory). If cwp anchoring is wrong and the
reference resolves against the root fixture/ dir, it picks THIS malformed file
and fails to parse (registry parse count stays 0) — the regression test catches
that. With correct anchoring the reference resolves to sub/leaf.usda and parses.
